---
import Side from './Side.astro';
import Top from './Top.astro';
---
<Side active="Atlas" />
<div class="mk-main">
  <Top title="Atlas" sub="Trained on your Vault only"><span class="mk-tag grey">Vault · 61 documents</span></Top>
  <div class="mk-body">
    <div class="mk-msgs">
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av">LO</span><div><p>What did we agree with Rift Valley for Mara North game drives this March, and is the park fee included?</p></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av ghost">A</span><div>
        <p>Your 2026 agreement sets shared game drives at <b>USD 95 per person per day</b> from 1 Nov to 31 Mar, private vehicle at USD 320 per day. Mara North conservancy fees are <b>not</b> included — USD 116 per adult per night, payable through them. Your March quote for KE-2291 should add USD 928 for two.</p>
        <span class="mk-cite"><i></i>Rift Valley GS — rates 2026.pdf · p.2, p.5</span>
        <small>From your Vault · no outside data</small>
      </div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av">LO</span><div><p>Draft the quote line with our 18% margin.</p></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av ghost">A</span><div>
        <p>Drafted into KE-2291 → Quotation. Four game-drive days plus fees, USD 1,688 net, <b>USD 1,992 quoted</b>. Not sent — it waits for you.</p>
        <small>Added to the trip · you approve before the traveller sees it</small>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mk-compose"><span>Ask about your contracts, rates and past trips…</span><span class="mk-btn">Ask</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
